  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the grimy alleys of Street Rubbers Roost, 'Zipcord' learned early that survival meant being faster and crazier than the next duck. He's made a name for himself as the go-to scavenger for rare tech scraps, often venturing into the most radiated sectors of Subchain City.",
    "class": "Tech Scavenger",
    "name": "Zipcord",
    "personality": "Zipcord is reckless, but remarkably resourceful. He's prone to impulsive decisions, often fueled by a desperate need for DRIP, but possesses a knack for uncovering hidden tech and jury-rigging solutions in a pinch. Beneath the bravado lies a surprisingly protective streak for those he considers part of his 'flock'.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Zipcord can temporarily overdrive his cybernetic enhancements (courtesy of his To-Kill-Ya hands and Vigilanti Cryo face mod), boosting his evasion and tech-scavenging speed for a short period. This also significantly increases his critical hit chance for a limited time, useful for making a quick escape or disabling a key enemy unit.",
